"notes":[
"New models: the Tollkeeper is a verdigris toll-collector hung with coin chains, and the Act IV minions each have their own look (the Lantern-wight carries a glowing paper lantern; Toll-stones and Grave-candles are carved and lit).",
"The Hollow King wears a gold crown and glows gold inside its maw instead of being a gold-tinted Engulfer; both now show their rings of teeth to the camera and walk on jointed, splayed legs.",
"The Earth Wurm bursts in an S-curve out of a ring of broken earth, the Iron Juggernaut is clad in angular plate with a bucket helm, and the Clockwork Hawk has real feathered wings.",
"Bridges are rebuilt with a laid flagstone deck, sturdier walls and lamp posts that match the map lamps (Riverfork, Ashfall, Lantern Cross).",
"Fixed: on Low graphics, and in portraits and icons (such as the Tollkeeper in the campaign story scenes), the Ferryman, the Coil and the new Act IV models showed nothing."
]
}